        "# Context variable\n",
        "\n",
        "A context variable stores a value associated with the current context, rather than a single global value. The `contextvars` module supports context-local state in asynchronous code.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-context-variable)"
      ]
    }
